      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Toss bok choy, green onions, and ramen noodles with the almonds.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Whisk 1/2 cup canola oil, sugar, balsamic vinaigrette dressing, and soy sauce in a separate bowl until combined.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": []
    },
    {
      "text": "Pour dressing over vegetables and toss to mix.",
